WEBVTT

00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:01.569
Do you want a personal

00:00:01.569 --> 00:00:03.219
assistant who's going to

00:00:03.219 --> 00:00:04.819
catch you every time

00:00:04.819 --> 00:00:05.379
when you become

00:00:05.379 --> 00:00:06.698
emotional?

00:00:06.698 --> 00:00:07.988
Stop you from saying

00:00:07.988 --> 00:00:09.563
stupid things?

00:00:09.563 --> 00:00:10.600
I do.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.970
Recently I've been using

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:13.260
AI as this personal

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.497
assistant.

00:00:14.497 --> 00:00:16.587
When I feel myself become

00:00:16.587 --> 00:00:18.487
emotional, frustrated,

00:00:18.487 --> 00:00:19.598
angry,

00:00:19.598 --> 00:00:21.818
I use voice input to talk

00:00:21.818 --> 00:00:23.946
to AI directly, with the

00:00:23.946 --> 00:00:25.145
raw emotion.

00:00:25.145 --> 00:00:27.078
For example: 'Why did you

00:00:27.078 --> 00:00:28.565
break this promise

00:00:28.565 --> 00:00:28.770
again?'

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:29.880
'Why did you tell

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.105
somebody else something

00:00:32.105 --> 00:00:33.899
that never happened?'

00:00:33.899 --> 00:00:35.039
You usually become angry

00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:36.239
when you see these kinds

00:00:36.239 --> 00:00:36.819
of things,

00:00:36.819 --> 00:00:37.999
but you don't want to

00:00:37.999 --> 00:00:39.229
bring that anger to

00:00:39.229 --> 00:00:40.739
people directly, in a

00:00:40.739 --> 00:00:42.642
work context.

00:00:42.642 --> 00:00:44.467
So instead, I use AI.

00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:46.598
I just talk to it with

00:00:46.598 --> 00:00:48.231
the raw emotion, with

00:00:48.231 --> 00:00:49.770
some information.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.410
And then I ask AI,

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:52.432
candidly:

00:00:52.432 --> 00:00:54.284
'Can you please filter

00:00:54.284 --> 00:00:56.414
out the emotion, just

00:00:56.414 --> 00:00:57.924
leave the facts, and

00:00:57.924 --> 00:01:00.000
format the message?'

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.510
In this way, I can send

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:03.260
the message without the

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.898
emotion, only facts left,

00:01:05.898 --> 00:01:07.628
to the people, in writing

00:01:07.628 --> 00:01:09.179
or verbally.

00:01:09.179 --> 00:01:10.589
So in this way I can

00:01:10.589 --> 00:01:11.934
still deliver the

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:12.669
message, I can still

00:01:12.669 --> 00:01:14.532
deliver the information,

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:16.130
without hurting people.

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:17.630
So this is my small tip

00:01:17.630 --> 00:01:19.233
of using AI as a personal

00:01:19.233 --> 00:01:20.422
assistant

00:01:20.422 --> 00:01:23.182
to filter raw emotions.

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:24.202
Do you have any similar

00:01:24.202 --> 00:01:25.662
experiences?
